window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I was supposed to be the bachelor—the only bachelor.</p> <p>Now I'm sharing the gorgeous contestants with the tiger tool. It'll be fun he said, no attachment, no strings.</p> <p>Realms, was he wrong.</p> <p>With a bachelorette missing, the entire island is in an uproar, and I have a really bad feeling it’s all my fault. I may have ticked off a few demons on my rise to the top. And now, someone’s taking it out on the contestants.</p> <p>As if dealing with kidnapping and sabotage isn’t bad enough, I never expected I’d have to battle my own heart. The dark, shriveled up thing wasn’t ever supposed to get in the way of my fun. Only now, I’m having feelings… </p> <p>What’s a demon dark lord bachelor supposed to do?</p> <p><b>Continue this steamy and thrilling second chance, new adult paranormal romance full of tension, mystery, and intrigue in two bachelors' search for true love</b> ♥</p> <p><i>***Author's note: Dark Desire is an ADULT paranormal romance with some dark themes, possessive males, and adult language. It was originally published on Kindle Vella as Hitched Live (Season Two). It is set within the world of Azar, along with (in reading order) Hitched, Darkblood Academy, Royally Hitched, Darkblood Prison, Wolfish, Vampish, Of Gods and Wolves, and the Hitched Live series (see below) but it's not necessary to have explored the other series first to enjoy this one.</i> </p> <p>The Hitched Live Series (Season One)</p> <p>Sweet Revenge</p> <p>Wicked Games</p> <p>Savage Love </p> <p>The Hitched Live Series (Season Two)</p> <p>Sweet Temptation</p> <p>Dark Desire</p> <p>True Love</p>"; 
